            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Koegaki 1.12.2</h2>
<ul>
    <li>This release is for the Mac. Windows stays on 1.11.1.</li>
    <li>Custom words now bias recognition more carefully: a saved name is kept only when the whole word is heard, so the bias no longer changes the capitals and spellings of ordinary sentences, and names like Nguyen can now be caught.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
